OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sexually abusing
OL,4,Agirl two decades ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 74-year-old man has been jailed for
OL,7,Fsexually abusing a girl more than 20
OL,8,Fyears ago.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said Terrance
OL,11,FTaylor carried out the offences in the
OL,12,Fmid-2000s and was arrested after his
OL,13,Fvictim, who is now an adult, came
OL,14,Fforward to report it in 2024.
OL,16,FAt Leicester Crown Court in August he
OL,17,Fwas found guilty of two counts of
OL,18,Fassaulting a girl under 13 by
OL,19,Fpenetration and two counts of sexual
OL,20,Fassault of a child under 13.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
